From: Liuqin Linux contributors
Subject: [PATCH] media: add liuqin AAC IMX596 and Q-Tech GT9764

Use the stock 19.2 MHz sensor init and binned mode, front module supplies
and CSI2 wiring, and the rear module actuator register sequence.

Describe the read-only front GT24P64E EEPROM at 0x51. Keep the at24
node disabled so that IMX596 can own power and access to the module.

